WEBVTT

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:13.960
<i>When you asked me how I felt about you</i>

00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:20.300
<i>I said, "You're okay, I guess."</i>

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:25.040
<i>Wait, are you crying?</i>

00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:26.340
<i>Oh!</i>

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:30.500
<i>Now I think you might be cute.</i>

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:37.000
<i>Then you tried to run away 
so I grabbed your hand.</i>

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:42.790
<i>And something deep within 
my heart began to dance.</i>

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:48.990
<i>I wish there were a textbook for romance.</i>

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:55.100
<i>There are just too many 
problems I don't understand.</i>

00:00:55.320 --> 00:01:01.240
<i>I wish there were a teacher for romance.</i>

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:03.520
<i>If I add You + Me</i>

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:08.000
<i>Will the answer be "Love"?</i>

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:18.780
That was AWESOME!

00:01:18.390 --> 00:01:22.960
"The Boy You Like? The Boy From Your Past?"

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:20.520
Yeah, I freaking DIED!

00:01:20.520 --> 00:01:21.570
So moving!

00:01:21.570 --> 00:01:22.960
Yes, so moving!

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:26.380
But I think having it in 
Osaka was what did it.

00:01:26.380 --> 00:01:28.020
Seeing him live was so bad-ass!

00:01:28.010 --> 00:01:28.890
So bad-ass!

00:01:28.890 --> 00:01:29.850
He was so sick!

00:01:29.850 --> 00:01:30.960
So sick!

00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:32.060
Amazing!

00:01:32.060 --> 00:01:32.940
Risa?

00:01:34.530 --> 00:01:37.320
Risa!

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:39.340
HUG

00:01:42.380 --> 00:01:46.570
Wh-who?! Who?! Who're you?!

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:48.680
It's me. Haruka.

00:01:48.680 --> 00:01:50.000
Haruka Fukagawa.

00:01:51.170 --> 00:01:52.380
Haruka?

00:01:52.890 --> 00:01:54.060
Don't you remember me?

00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:57.570
Come on! I lived in your neighborhood 
when we were in grade school!

00:01:57.570 --> 00:01:59.220
Grade school?

00:01:58.260 --> 00:01:59.870
Shiver, shiver

00:01:59.870 --> 00:02:01.870
5% Recollection

00:01:59.870 --> 00:02:21.450
Risa's Memory

00:02:01.870 --> 00:02:09.110
25% Recollection

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:06.640
He's not a boy, he's a GIRL.

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:09.120
He's probably got boobs.

00:02:09.110 --> 00:02:12.380
40% Recollection

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:11.380
I don't have boobs!

00:02:11.380 --> 00:02:12.600
Hey there!

00:02:12.380 --> 00:02:13.110
50% Recollection

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:17.080
70% Recollection

00:02:13.520 --> 00:02:15.780
Are you guys teasing Haruka AGAIN?

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:17.580
- She's here!
- Run for it!

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:18.320
90% Recollection

00:02:17.580 --> 00:02:19.090
Risa...

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:21.520
100% Recollection

00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:21.690
Oh, you're THAT Haruka!

00:02:21.690 --> 00:02:23.010
Yes! "That" Haruka!

00:02:23.010 --> 00:02:25.380
Wow, it's been forever!

00:02:25.380 --> 00:02:26.780
I didn't recognize you.

00:02:26.780 --> 00:02:28.960
Hey, didn't you go overseas?

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:30.080
I just came back.

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:31.130
You sure got big.

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:33.540
I'm 185cm.

00:02:33.810 --> 00:02:35.960
I'm finally taller than you, Risa.

00:02:35.960 --> 00:02:39.100
Wow, it really is you. Takes me back...

00:02:40.020 --> 00:02:41.040
I'm leaving.

00:02:42.610 --> 00:02:44.380
Hey, Otani?

00:02:44.380 --> 00:02:45.900
Sure has been forever.

00:02:45.900 --> 00:02:47.240
How's your mom?

00:02:47.240 --> 00:02:49.520
Fine. What about yours?

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:51.940
Everyone in my family is doing really well.

00:02:52.570 --> 00:02:53.810
That's good...

00:02:53.810 --> 00:02:55.690
Risa, where are you going to school?

00:02:56.600 --> 00:02:57.730
Maido Academy.

00:02:57.730 --> 00:02:59.420
Oh, I know that place...

00:03:12.890 --> 00:03:13.970
Hey, all...

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:15.470
Hap-year!

00:03:15.730 --> 00:03:17.340
Hap-year!

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:21.040
'Sup. You sure got taller 
while I wasn't looking.

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:22.280
No , I haven't!

00:03:31.740 --> 00:03:34.250
So what happened with your ex?

00:03:34.820 --> 00:03:36.130
Nothing really.

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:43.440
What about you?

00:03:43.880 --> 00:03:45.280
Who was that guy?

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:46.970
What guy?

00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:50.140
That guy who suddenly threw his arms 
around you in the middle of the street.

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:53.810
Oh, Haruka?

00:03:53.810 --> 00:03:55.890
He's like an old friend.

00:03:55.890 --> 00:03:58.340
In fifth grade he moved overseas.

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:01.130
...Are you curious?

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:04.720
What about you? You keep asking about my ex.

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:28.550
- This year for sure, may 
I please get a boyfriend!

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:28.800
Something's wafting out of you...

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:30.100
Shut up!

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:39.050
Hey, follow me!

00:04:39.050 --> 00:04:41.040
What's your problem?

00:04:41.980 --> 00:04:43.420
Come on, Otani.

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:44.780
What is it?

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:47.820
Kanzaki.

00:04:48.210 --> 00:04:49.690
Atsushi...

00:04:50.580 --> 00:04:52.540
H-how've you been?

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:58.720
Is this the girl you went to 
the Christmas concert with?

00:04:58.720 --> 00:05:00.320
I'm Risa Koizumi!

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:01.930
I apologize for my recent intrusion.

00:05:01.930 --> 00:05:06.280
No, I'M sorry! I wasn't aware 
that Atsushi was seeing someone.

00:05:07.360 --> 00:05:09.190
No, no, no! No, no, no!

00:05:09.190 --> 00:05:12.060
There's NOTHING between Otani and me!

00:05:12.930 --> 00:05:16.240
There's not even a dog's claw 
holding our hearts together!

00:05:12.930 --> 00:05:16.240
(*this is a Japanese idiom 
that she's messing up)

00:05:16.240 --> 00:05:20.810
So if there's something you want to tell 
Otani, forget I'm here and just say it! Okay?

00:05:20.810 --> 00:05:22.320
Okay, okay, okay?

00:05:23.330 --> 00:05:25.400
I'm rooting for you guys, okay?

00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:28.410
I don't know what happened in your 
past, but I'm rooting for ya lots!

00:05:28.880 --> 00:05:31.260
Stop it - maybe she doesn't want to talk.

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:33.640
But why not? Don't you 
wanna know how she feels?

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:35.880
You need to let her tell you!

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:36.950
I didn't ask for your help!

00:05:37.160 --> 00:05:38.610
Umm...

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:42.890
Umm, it wasn't because of his height.

00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:48.320
I just happened to fall 
for someone who was tall.

00:05:48.920 --> 00:05:51.860
I didn't dump you because you're short.

00:05:51.860 --> 00:05:52.830
Heh?

00:05:53.090 --> 00:05:54.540
But thinking about it after the fact,

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:57.880
I realized you might have thought I 
was doing it on purpose to hurt you.

00:05:57.880 --> 00:06:00.920
But I also didn't want to open 
a can of worms by telling you...

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:02.660
Umm...sorry.

00:06:02.660 --> 00:06:06.160
There's just one aspect of this 
situation that I can't understand.

00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:08.140
You wanted to "talk" to him...about that?

00:06:08.140 --> 00:06:08.930
Yes.

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:10.730
And I'm glad I did.

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:11.780
Clear

00:06:10.730 --> 00:06:12.520
It really cleared my head.

00:06:14.980 --> 00:06:16.410
Well, bye then...

00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:20.860
Moronnnnn

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:26.920
I'm sorry, Otani!

00:06:26.920 --> 00:06:29.980
Freaking sorry! Seriously sorry! 
Completely and utterly sorry!

00:06:29.980 --> 00:06:34.060
Burn me, boil me, or cut me 
into pieces - do as you please!

00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:34.960
Koizumi...

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:36.530
I'm sorry!

00:06:36.530 --> 00:06:38.650
I had no idea that would happen!

00:06:38.650 --> 00:06:41.010
I just assumed she wanted to 
get back together with you.

00:06:41.680 --> 00:06:43.310
Gonnng

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:44.720
Now I've gone and made things worse...

00:06:44.720 --> 00:06:45.680
Thanks.

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:48.540
I wouldn't've heard her say 
that if it weren't for you.

00:06:49.160 --> 00:06:51.860
What the hell? You should 
be mad at me! I was so--

00:06:51.860 --> 00:06:52.990
Just drop it!

00:06:53.980 --> 00:06:54.940
It's fine...

00:06:56.250 --> 00:06:59.200
A part of me was hoping she 
wanted to get back together...

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:01.830
But hearing her say that 
finally gave me closure.

00:07:05.280 --> 00:07:07.610
It's just words, after all.

00:07:08.450 --> 00:07:11.320
Are you...

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:14.140
Ah, there you are!

00:07:14.850 --> 00:07:17.560
Hey! Wanna go eat some O-shiruko?

00:07:17.560 --> 00:07:19.460
Yes, please!!

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:26.620
So the boyfriend/girlfriend competition 
slipped out of our heads for a while.

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:30.730
And before we knew it, 
Valentine's Day was upon us!

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:34.500
Chiharu, which do you think is better:

00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:36.380
chocolate cookies, or chocolate cake?

00:07:36.820 --> 00:07:39.300
Cookies seem easier to make.

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:40.450
Sure thing.

00:07:40.450 --> 00:07:42.540
Look, let's make these cookies together.

00:07:42.540 --> 00:07:44.540
Yeah, they look yummy!

00:07:45.020 --> 00:07:47.250
Looks like you're having fun.

00:07:46.540 --> 00:07:47.250
Hmph.

00:07:47.530 --> 00:07:50.250
She did suggest we make these TOGETHER.

00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:53.250
But I don't have anyone 
to give my chocolate to.

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:54.720
What about Otani?

00:07:54.720 --> 00:07:57.700
Why must I give chocolate to Otani?

00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:00.450
To apologize for jumping to false conclusions

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:02.290
and messing with his romantic prospects.

00:08:02.940 --> 00:08:04.330
Well, I was just...

00:08:04.600 --> 00:08:06.360
See? It's a great opportunity.

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:09.930
Hiiii there.

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:12.400
Smile

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:15.020
You're in an unusually good mood today.

00:08:15.020 --> 00:08:16.410
Lemme borrow your ears.

00:08:16.410 --> 00:08:17.440
My ears?

00:08:17.440 --> 00:08:18.380
Here.

00:08:18.380 --> 00:08:23.720
SEA

00:08:19.860 --> 00:08:22.330
What's this? Sea Monk's newest track?

00:08:22.330 --> 00:08:23.720
Not quite.

00:08:23.960 --> 00:08:25.600
An album from his Indies era!

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:27.190
Sea Monk

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:27.440
I found it at a used CD store.

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:29.080
For reals?!

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:31.860
It's out of print so it's 
really hard to find!

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:33.160
Seriously?!

00:08:33.690 --> 00:08:35.060
They sure look happy together.

00:08:35.060 --> 00:08:39.400
Yet they still haven't hooked 
up yet - I blame Sea Monk.

00:08:39.800 --> 00:08:46.540
Osaka Ramen

00:08:39.970 --> 00:08:43.330
Karaoke. 1 hour for 120 yen

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:50.860
I made it myself.

00:08:50.860 --> 00:08:52.640
Please take my chocolate!

00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:58.580
Hey, for Valentine's Day, would 
you rather have cookies or cake?

00:08:58.580 --> 00:09:00.360
Are you baking them?

00:09:00.360 --> 00:09:02.200
Yep. Risa's making some too.

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:03.660
Hey, there you go again...

00:09:03.660 --> 00:09:07.250
Gross! Who the hell is gonna 
be the poor victim who eats it?

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:08.530
What do you mean "victim"?

00:09:08.530 --> 00:09:12.660
Anyone who eats chocolate made by 
a giantess is sure to get sick.

00:09:12.660 --> 00:09:13.700
Or maybe even become a giant himself!

00:09:16.330 --> 00:09:17.240
Koizumi?

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:18.050
I know.

00:09:18.050 --> 00:09:22.240
No one would be pleased to get 
chocolate from a giantess like me.

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:25.340
After all, unlike SOMEBODY, I've 
never been in a relationship.

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:28.820
I don't even have a gaggle 
of groupies call me "cute."

00:09:29.890 --> 00:09:31.440
I'm just a...

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:32.370
I'm just a...

00:09:32.370 --> 00:09:33.220
Hey...

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:37.930
I'm just a lonely soul who will die 
having never given anyone chocolate!

00:09:38.880 --> 00:09:40.160
Cool it, Koizumi!

00:09:40.420 --> 00:09:41.640
What the hell?

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:43.400
Why're you sulking?

00:09:43.400 --> 00:09:44.230
No reason.

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:47.980
Fine.

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:49.500
I'll eat your chocolate.

00:09:50.840 --> 00:09:53.850
I don't need your pity or charity.

00:09:53.850 --> 00:09:54.940
It's not pity.

00:09:56.090 --> 00:09:57.660
I like sweets.

00:09:58.160 --> 00:10:00.980
You don't have to give me chocolate.

00:10:00.980 --> 00:10:03.310
I want a chocolate cake.

00:10:04.570 --> 00:10:07.490
I never said I'd give you one!

00:10:07.490 --> 00:10:09.490
Just a suggestion.

00:10:18.050 --> 00:10:19.760
Otani, you're being sluggish!

00:10:19.760 --> 00:10:20.700
Yes, sir!

00:10:23.330 --> 00:10:24.500
Umm...

00:10:26.840 --> 00:10:30.100
We see you hanging around Otani a lot...

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:31.760
Are you guys dating?

00:10:31.760 --> 00:10:33.570
No, no, that's ridiculous!

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:35.330
I thought so!

00:10:35.330 --> 00:10:37.250
Of course they wouldn't date.

00:10:38.640 --> 00:10:41.690
Otani would never go for 
a tall girl like that.

00:10:41.690 --> 00:10:43.010
Totally!

00:10:43.010 --> 00:10:44.770
That's for sure!

00:10:44.770 --> 00:10:47.840
I wonder if those girls 
will give Otani chocolate?

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:49.840
Probably.

00:10:50.490 --> 00:10:53.800
With all their chocolate, 
he won't really need mine.

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:55.300
Risa.

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:58.690
Risa!!

00:10:59.600 --> 00:11:00.680
Risa!

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:02.300
Together again!

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:04.340
Haruka, I can't breathe...

00:11:04.820 --> 00:11:06.340
Who's that guy?

00:11:10.180 --> 00:11:11.580
That was a close one.

00:11:11.890 --> 00:11:13.990
You bastard...

00:11:25.560 --> 00:11:28.000
Why was he here yesterday?

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:29.770
Apparently he's transferring.

00:11:30.760 --> 00:11:32.320
He's transferring here?

00:11:32.320 --> 00:11:34.040
Yep. Starting in April.

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:36.010
Well, good for you.

00:11:36.010 --> 00:11:38.280
He's the type of handsome guy you like.

00:11:40.100 --> 00:11:44.620
Not exactly. He used to be such a sissy.

00:11:45.740 --> 00:11:47.700
His grandmother was English or something

00:11:46.980 --> 00:11:50.620
Haruka

00:11:47.700 --> 00:11:50.610
and he really was a lot like a girl.

00:11:50.610 --> 00:11:52.450
His friends were all girls.

00:11:52.450 --> 00:11:54.590
I'd go so far as to say 
he's a girl on the inside.

00:11:54.590 --> 00:11:56.260
What a lame guy.

00:11:56.260 --> 00:11:57.400
Right?

00:11:57.400 --> 00:12:00.060
Hard to shake the image, no 
matter how handsome he is now.

00:12:02.040 --> 00:12:03.260
Damn!

00:12:03.260 --> 00:12:06.380
I could've been cool and said 
he was an old boyfriend!

00:12:06.380 --> 00:12:07.780
Am I a moron?

00:12:07.780 --> 00:12:09.610
Why must I be so honest?!

00:12:09.890 --> 00:12:13.200
Ohhh, good. Here I thought I'd lost the bet.

00:12:13.200 --> 00:12:16.880
But I guess a giantess wouldn't 
get a boyfriend that easily.

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:17.820
I guess...

00:12:18.280 --> 00:12:20.440
I guess you're free today, right?

00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:23.150
Wanna come with me to the CD store 
to look for more rare Sea Monk goods?

00:12:25.370 --> 00:12:26.620
Risa?

00:12:27.250 --> 00:12:28.180
Risa!

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:30.610
This chocolate cake recipe looks really easy!

00:12:30.610 --> 00:12:31.810
Let's make it?

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:33.490
Oooh, looks yummy!

00:12:33.490 --> 00:12:35.240
Chocolate cake...

00:12:35.240 --> 00:12:36.880
I'll stock up on antacid...

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:37.970
It's not what you think!

00:12:37.970 --> 00:12:38.850
I'm not making it!

00:12:38.850 --> 00:12:39.970
Not for you!

00:12:39.970 --> 00:12:40.810
Yeah, sure.

00:12:52.560 --> 00:12:54.800
Risa!

00:12:55.450 --> 00:12:56.600
Not again...

00:12:56.600 --> 00:12:58.500
Haruka, what's up?

00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:00.100
I came to see you!

00:13:00.100 --> 00:13:01.720
Wanna have tea?

00:13:01.720 --> 00:13:05.980
Sorry, but I'm going with Otani today...

00:13:05.980 --> 00:13:06.700
"Otani"?

00:13:07.040 --> 00:13:08.290
I don't mind.

00:13:08.290 --> 00:13:08.920
I'll...

00:13:10.200 --> 00:13:12.160
What IS this mysterious little creature?!

00:13:12.530 --> 00:13:13.470
"Mysterious little creature"?

00:13:13.970 --> 00:13:17.440
Wait, Risa, weren't you with 
this little creature earlier?

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:19.240
Stop talking about me like I'm a pet!

00:13:19.240 --> 00:13:22.380
He doesn't suit a pretty girl like you, Risa.

00:13:22.650 --> 00:13:23.920
Awwww.

00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:25.080
"Pretty," my ass.

00:13:25.080 --> 00:13:26.580
Aww, STOP it...

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:30.850
This guy's lost his marbles.

00:13:30.850 --> 00:13:33.050
Wow, you're really rude!

00:13:33.050 --> 00:13:34.680
Who're YOU callin' rude?

00:13:34.680 --> 00:13:36.060
Wanna be slapped, baldy?

00:13:36.060 --> 00:13:38.200
I'm not balding at all, are ya stupid?

00:13:39.890 --> 00:13:40.660
Oh, crap!

00:13:40.660 --> 00:13:43.410
This guy's managed to cover all 
the bases that piss me off!

00:13:43.410 --> 00:13:45.570
There, there, Otani.

00:13:45.570 --> 00:13:46.690
"Otani"?

00:13:46.690 --> 00:13:49.240
Wait, HE'S the Otani you're 
hanging out with today?

00:13:49.240 --> 00:13:49.840
Yeah.

00:13:49.840 --> 00:13:51.410
You can't do that!

00:13:51.410 --> 00:13:52.940
You're so cool-looking!

00:13:52.940 --> 00:13:56.180
If you walk side by side with 
this guy, you'll look so lame!

00:13:57.260 --> 00:13:59.850
You've been my hero since we were kids!

00:14:00.140 --> 00:14:02.600
I want you looking cool at all times!

00:14:03.090 --> 00:14:04.160
"Hero"?

00:14:04.530 --> 00:14:05.490
I'm slapping this bitch!

00:14:05.490 --> 00:14:08.330
I'm sure even God would let it slide!

00:14:08.330 --> 00:14:09.360
Stay cool, Otani.

00:14:09.610 --> 00:14:12.060
Oh, shut up, little runt.

00:14:12.060 --> 00:14:13.780
Risa is my personal hero.

00:14:13.780 --> 00:14:14.890
I'm not sharing with you.

00:14:16.090 --> 00:14:17.440
Let's go, Risa.

00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:20.260
Hey? Wait? Haruka!

00:14:21.600 --> 00:14:22.370
St...

00:14:22.780 --> 00:14:25.310
Stop saying stuff that makes no sense!

00:14:26.220 --> 00:14:27.000
Next

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:27.810
Day

00:14:27.810 --> 00:14:28.810
Period

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:32.820
Let's see...umm...

00:14:33.300 --> 00:14:35.770
Haruka isn't a bad guy.

00:14:35.770 --> 00:14:39.100
Never before have I seen such 
a prime example of pure evil.

00:14:39.100 --> 00:14:40.010
Ah...

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:42.790
Stop throwing stuff at 
me that makes no sense.

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:45.500
I don't get it either! 
He's the one saying stuff.

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:47.840
But you're his "hero," do something about it!

00:14:47.840 --> 00:14:48.980
Hero...

00:14:48.980 --> 00:14:50.100
Hero, eh?

00:14:50.840 --> 00:14:53.740
He should be ashamed, letting a 
girl fight his battles for him.

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:54.780
What a loser.

00:14:54.780 --> 00:14:57.530
You should be more ashamed 
of yourself as a lame shorty.

00:14:57.530 --> 00:14:58.600
Haruka.

00:14:58.600 --> 00:15:00.020
Why you...!

00:15:00.020 --> 00:15:01.520
Good morning, Risa.

00:15:01.520 --> 00:15:03.220
Look, I brought you a lunch.

00:15:03.220 --> 00:15:04.290
Do you like cocktail wieners?

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:05.820
Sure...

00:15:06.290 --> 00:15:08.560
Hey, you can't just waltz 
into our classroom like that!

00:15:08.560 --> 00:15:10.060
You don't even go here yet!

00:15:10.060 --> 00:15:11.240
You impudent ass!

00:15:11.240 --> 00:15:13.490
You really are an annoying little runt!

00:15:13.490 --> 00:15:17.230
Little runts should curl up in 
the corner and sleep with mommy.

00:15:18.970 --> 00:15:22.000
Risa, would you come over here for a minute?

00:15:24.170 --> 00:15:28.940
The Three Stooges

00:15:24.600 --> 00:15:26.960
Presenting the Alien Hostage!

00:15:29.600 --> 00:15:31.580
YOU'RE GETTING SLAPPED, DAMN IT!

00:15:31.580 --> 00:15:33.280
Thanks for the lunch!

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:34.620
Well, you'd better get going.

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:36.500
Yeah, but wait!

00:15:36.500 --> 00:15:38.900
Hey, Otani, who was that?

00:15:38.900 --> 00:15:40.780
Her "old friend."

00:15:40.780 --> 00:15:42.850
They sure look good together.

00:15:42.850 --> 00:15:45.020
Like models, since they're so tall.

00:15:45.020 --> 00:15:47.700
Seeing Koizumi with him makes 
her look really pretty.

00:15:47.700 --> 00:15:49.580
I was just thinking that!

00:15:49.580 --> 00:15:51.640
That's true. She really is pretty.

00:15:51.640 --> 00:15:55.700
Whenever she's around Otani, she's 
just the All Hanshin Kyojin.

00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:58.570
WHY'RE YOU SAYING THE EXACT 
SAME THINGS HE'S SAYING?!

00:15:58.570 --> 00:16:01.500
SO IT'S MY FAULT KOIZUMI IS TALL?!

00:16:01.500 --> 00:16:03.210
It's starting to feel that way...

00:16:04.600 --> 00:16:06.770
I'm exhausted.

00:16:06.770 --> 00:16:07.880
GIANTESS!

00:16:07.880 --> 00:16:09.140
WHAT?!

00:16:09.140 --> 00:16:11.520
Back to the All Hanshin Kyojin.

00:16:15.970 --> 00:16:18.320
Risa, your cake turned out beautifully.

00:16:19.850 --> 00:16:22.860
So...I'm supposed to give this to Otani.

00:16:22.860 --> 00:16:23.720
Yep.

00:16:23.720 --> 00:16:26.280
I don't wanna.

00:16:26.280 --> 00:16:29.680
He's already in a horrible 
mood because of Haruka.

00:16:29.680 --> 00:16:32.810
I wonder if Haruka has a crush on you?

00:16:32.810 --> 00:16:37.090
Crush? More like, he sees me as a hero.

00:16:37.090 --> 00:16:37.880
"Hero"?

00:16:39.330 --> 00:16:41.410
A hero is usually male, too!

00:16:41.410 --> 00:16:43.040
Makes sense, seeing as how I'm not a girl.

00:16:43.040 --> 00:16:44.940
True, but he also said you're pretty.

00:16:44.940 --> 00:16:47.660
I honestly think that with a little 
work you could be a real heartbreaker.

00:16:47.660 --> 00:16:48.800
Shut up!

00:16:48.800 --> 00:16:50.400
"Effort"? What kind?

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:54.390
Like participating in a 
feminine sort of event.

00:16:54.390 --> 00:16:55.330
Come on.

00:16:57.960 --> 00:16:59.320
Wait...

00:16:59.320 --> 00:17:01.230
Some creepy stuff is wafting out of you.

00:17:09.490 --> 00:17:10.540
No thanks.

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:12.360
What did you just say?

00:17:12.840 --> 00:17:13.610
No thanks.

00:17:13.610 --> 00:17:16.860
But that makes me look 
pretty silly right now.

00:17:16.860 --> 00:17:17.650
Don't care.

00:17:17.650 --> 00:17:18.720
You don't care?

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:22.650
But I made this because you said you 
wanted it, not for Valentine's...

00:17:22.650 --> 00:17:24.180
I never wanted it!

00:17:24.500 --> 00:17:28.660
I only suggested it because I figured 
you had no one else to give it to!

00:17:28.660 --> 00:17:30.660
Yeah, but you can still have it...

00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:34.380
Now you have that annoying 
Haruka guy to give it to!

00:17:35.170 --> 00:17:37.130
But Haruka isn't...

00:17:37.460 --> 00:17:39.660
Koizumi is giving Otani chocolate!

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:41.070
No way! Really?

00:17:42.940 --> 00:17:44.440
No, this isn't...

00:17:44.440 --> 00:17:47.100
It's a CD! Just borrowing it...

00:17:47.100 --> 00:17:47.960
Yeah!

00:17:47.960 --> 00:17:50.180
That CD smells like chocolate.

00:17:50.710 --> 00:17:51.980
It's not for me.

00:17:51.980 --> 00:17:54.050
She's giving it to her old friend.

00:17:54.050 --> 00:17:54.880
Right?

00:17:54.880 --> 00:17:56.320
"Right"? But you...

00:17:59.120 --> 00:18:01.440
Yeah. Very well. He's correct.

00:18:01.440 --> 00:18:04.130
I am giving this to Haruka.

00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:22.750
I'll eat your chocolate.

00:18:30.400 --> 00:18:31.160
Risa.

00:18:31.880 --> 00:18:33.090
Haruka.

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:34.130
I came to see you today.

00:18:34.530 --> 00:18:36.370
Well, actually...

00:18:36.370 --> 00:18:39.460
I was hoping I might get 
some Valentine's chocolate.

00:18:43.770 --> 00:18:45.060
Here, it's yours.

00:18:47.810 --> 00:18:49.000
Seriously?

00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:50.160
Thanks!

00:18:50.160 --> 00:18:52.370
Yeah, you're welcome.

00:18:52.370 --> 00:18:54.290
I could never eat it - what a waste!

00:18:54.290 --> 00:18:55.880
I'll treasure it forever!

00:18:55.880 --> 00:18:58.080
Don't! Eat it before it rots!

00:18:58.080 --> 00:19:00.500
I'll keep it with the chocolate 
you gave me years ago.

00:19:00.500 --> 00:19:02.050
Don't keep it! Throw it out!

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:03.120
No thanks.

00:19:05.440 --> 00:19:07.450
Hey, will you come with me?

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:15.940
Yahoo!

00:19:15.940 --> 00:19:17.000
I lost again...

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:23.770
That felt good!

00:19:23.770 --> 00:19:25.860
You're still a video game master, I see.

00:19:25.860 --> 00:19:28.460
You always look cool, no matter what you do.

00:19:28.460 --> 00:19:31.610
I appreciate the sentiment, but 
that doesn't really matter to me.

00:19:31.610 --> 00:19:34.920
Why not? That's what I love most about you.

00:19:36.120 --> 00:19:38.530
But you're the only one who ever says that.

00:19:38.530 --> 00:19:42.280
All the kids at school think 
of me as a comedy act.

00:19:42.280 --> 00:19:44.420
That's because you're 
always around that runt.

00:19:44.420 --> 00:19:46.500
What IS he to you anyway?

00:19:46.900 --> 00:19:48.010
What is he?

00:19:48.010 --> 00:19:50.180
Nothing, really.

00:19:50.180 --> 00:19:53.010
We just live near each other, 
so we walk home together.

00:19:53.010 --> 00:19:54.680
But you're cool, Risa!

00:19:54.680 --> 00:19:57.930
You're wasting your looks 
when you stand next to him.

00:19:57.930 --> 00:20:00.580
That may be true, but 
he's got his good points.

00:20:00.580 --> 00:20:04.520
Even though he's small, he's 
really good at basketball.

00:20:06.690 --> 00:20:10.200
And he's always there when I need him.

00:20:11.420 --> 00:20:13.120
And at Christmas...

00:20:20.800 --> 00:20:21.660
Risa...

00:20:23.130 --> 00:20:26.400
Anyway, he's not a bad guy!

00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:27.740
Risa...

00:20:28.900 --> 00:20:31.110
Risa, do you like him?

00:20:32.220 --> 00:20:33.640
Where did that come from?

00:20:33.640 --> 00:20:35.250
Of course I don't!

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:36.460
Well, whatever.

00:20:37.240 --> 00:20:41.340
In any case, I won't let 
that runt upstage me.

00:20:43.580 --> 00:20:46.860
I want you to be my girlfriend.

00:20:46.860 --> 00:20:49.850
I dream of a highschool life full of love.

00:20:50.400 --> 00:20:54.980
Someday, I'll tell you that I 
like you and want to go out.

00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:56.200
Start thinking about your answer.

00:21:26.120 --> 00:21:26.860
Sorry.

00:21:30.480 --> 00:21:32.440
It's okay. It was just 
obligatory chocolate anyway.

00:21:33.130 --> 00:21:35.210
That's right. Obligatory chocolate.

00:21:44.850 --> 00:21:46.320
Obligatory

00:21:46.320 --> 00:21:49.950
Clannnnng

00:21:50.750 --> 00:21:58.040
<i>On the way home from school, alone 
in the park, sitting on our bench,</i>

00:21:58.040 --> 00:22:02.880
<i>I noticed you were happier than usual</i>

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:05.320
<i>So I asked you,</i>

00:22:05.320 --> 00:22:12.600
<i>"What would you do if the world disappeared?"</i>

00:22:12.600 --> 00:22:20.730
<i>Saying nothing, you squeezed 
my arm in response.</i>

00:22:21.370 --> 00:22:26.720
<i>Please, keep looking at me.</i>

00:22:26.720 --> 00:22:34.550
<i>Our lips are too close and 
my heart won't stop pounding.</i>

00:22:35.990 --> 00:22:41.870
<i>No matter what mood you're in, 
I'll accept you for who you are.</i>

00:22:41.870 --> 00:22:50.350
<i>And if your heart ever breaks 
and tears fall down your cheeks,</i>

00:22:50.350 --> 00:22:56.470
<i>I will protect you even if it means 
turning the rest of the world against me.</i>

00:22:56.470 --> 00:22:57.790
<i>I love you</i>

00:22:57.790 --> 00:23:01.410
<i>I don't need words.</i>

00:23:01.410 --> 00:23:06.870
<i>You will be my last kiss.</i>

00:23:07.330 --> 00:23:11.570
<i>Now and forever.</i>

00:23:27.370 --> 00:23:29.050
Otani's kissing someone!

00:23:29.050 --> 00:23:31.490
The era of little men has arrived!

00:23:31.490 --> 00:23:32.600
Never heard of it.

00:23:32.600 --> 00:23:35.190
Lovely Complex - Love Com

00:23:35.190 --> 00:23:37.190
Next episode, "Smooch! I've Fallen In Love!"

00:23:37.190 --> 00:23:39.930
Smooch! I've Fallen In Love!

00:23:37.650 --> 00:23:39.200
Don't miss it!
